  "cmd_full_name": "ccc reset-user-password",
  "cmd_name": "reset-user-password",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Invoke ResetUserPassword to reset the logon password of a specified agent under a specified instance. In practice, agents do not have logon passwords; this operation actually modifies the logon password of the RAM account associated with the agent. This is typically used in scenarios where a customer service representative forgets the logon password of their RAM account",
